Data notice
-----------
The code above is MIT-licensed. The data shipped in data/reference/ is not:
it is the ISIMIP2a input dataset `population_histsoc_national_annual`
(HYDE methodology), served by the ISIMIP data portal hosted by IIASA and
published under CC BY 4.0 (Attribution 4.0 International). Attribution to
ISIMIP / IIASA and to the HYDE methodology is required, and dataset rights
should be re-checked at the portal before reuse. The SHA-512 digest recorded
in data/reference/PROVENANCE.md identifies the exact version used here.
